      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i need some help writing an email to my boss. our current project is starting to deal with a ton of scope creep and my team is getting stretched way too thin. i need to ask for either more people on the project or an extension on the deadline, but i want to sound professional and not like i'm just complaining. can you help me draft something?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
