      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, this is a good start. i think i'll go with the first option (adding more people) because the deadline is pretty set in stone. can you make it sound a bit more data-driven? maybe mention that the \"creeping\" requirements are specifically what's causing the bottleneck so it sounds less like we're just being slow.",
